      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Argument resolver to extract a <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> object from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/request/NativeWebRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context.request\"><code>NativeWebRequest</code></a> for a particular\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>. A <a href=\"OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver</code></a> can either resolve\n<a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> itself or wrap another <a href=\"OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver</code></a> to post-process\n<a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于从特定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/request/NativeWebRequest.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.web.context.request\"><code>NativeWebRequest</code></a> 中提取 <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> 对象的参数解析器。<a href=\"OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web 中的接口\"><code>OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver</code></a> 既可以解析 <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> 本身，也可以包装另一个 <a href=\"OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.web 中的接口\"><code>OffsetScrollPositionArgumentResolver</code></a> 以对 <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> 进行后处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> method parameter into an argument value from a given request. Supports also\nwrapped arguments in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 `<a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a>` 方法参数解析为来自给定请求的参数值。此外，还支持包装在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Optional.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Optional</code></a> 中的参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a> method parameter into an argument value from a given request.",
      "translation": "将给定的请求中的参数值解析为 `<a href=\"../domain/OffsetScrollPosition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>OffsetScrollPosition</code></a>` 方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">resolveArgument</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.web.method.support\">resolveArgument</a></code> 是接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code> 中的方法",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must have previously been passed to\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must have returned true.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须此前已传递给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/method/support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该方法必须返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>binderFactory</code> - a factory for creating <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instances",
      "translation": "<code>binderFactory</code> - 用于创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的工厂",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved argument value or null if the value cannot be resolved. The returned value\n        considers <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html#isOptional()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Optional</code></a> wrapping by returing either the value wrapped\n        within Optional or Optional.empty().",
      "translation": "已解析的实参值，或者在无法解析该值时返回 null。返回值会考虑对 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html#isOptional()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Optional</code></a>` 的包装，通过返回 Optional 中封装的值或 Optional.empty() 来实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mavContainer</code> - the ModelAndViewContainer for the current request",
      "translation": "<code>mavContainer</code> - 当前请求的 ModelAndViewContainer",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>webRequest</code> - the current request",
      "translation": "<code>webRequest</code> - 当前请求",
      "count": 1
